    {
      "claim": "The missing advisory does not send this case to a human reviewer. POL-RD-13(1) is explicit: where the asserting party names no evidence ID for an advisory, the absent advisory is not an exculpatory clause 'invoked against a cited artifact' within POL-RD-10(5) — an assertion that cites no artifact cannot be invoked against one — and the gap is a gap in the bundle, not a contradiction in it. POL-RD-13(2) then directs the result: the deviation stands at the measured figure, POL-RD-02 runs against the booked 15.0 km optimal, and the assertion is recorded as discarded with no advisory on file. POL-RD-13 expressly leaves POL-RD-10(3) untouched only where the trace itself is impaired, which it is not here.",
